- Docs/Agent/Skill: deckent_docs, deckent_agent_list, deckent_skill_list, deckent_kill
- Nervous: deckent_nervous_subscribe, deckent_nervous_accept, deckent_nervous_reject, deckent_nervous_status, deckent_nervous_config
- Sprint 150 Beta Trio: deckent_audit, deckent_feature_query, deckent_recover

## Approach
1. Locate MCP server registration code (src/mcp/server.ts or similar)
2. Read tool schema definitions for each of the 12 tools
3. For each tool, smoke via stdio JSON-RPC if possible, OR verify schema/handler existence
4. NEVER actually invoke deckent_kill (destructive)
5. For nervous tools, verify Sprint 150A hot fix presence
6. For beta trio, verify Sprint 150 T-151-... context

## Deliverable
